SHELL
  verify the SDK:            dotnet --version
  create empty web project:  dotnet new web -n HelloApi
  enter the folder:          cd HelloApi

NO PACKAGES
  everything in this primer ships with ASP.NET Core

LOOK AT what the template made
  HelloApi.csproj                  Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Web"  -> web server + minimal APIs
  Program.cs                       four lines: builder, app, one MapGet, Run
  appsettings.json                 base configuration
  appsettings.Development.json     overrides for Development
  Properties/launchSettings.json   port + ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT for "dotnet run"

EDIT
  appsettings.json: ADD section "Library" with Name and Greeting
  appsettings.Development.json: ADD section "Library" with a different Greeting only

CHECK
  dotnet run, open the URL printed in the console, see "Hello World!"
